{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21982","headline":"浔阳三题 湓浦竹 · 白居易","name":"浔阳三题 湓浦竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浔阳十月天，天气仍温燠。\n有霜不杀草，有风不落木。\n玄冥气力薄，草木冬犹绿。\n谁肯湓浦头，回眼看修竹。\n其有顾盼者，持刀斩且束。\n剖劈青琅玕，家家盖墙屋。\n吾闻汾晋间，竹少重如玉。\n胡爲取轻贱，生此西江曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}